Subject: Accept FB2 ZIP uploads through both book upload widgets
Depends-on: 0001-normalize-fb2zip-uploads.patch

Use .zip for native file pickers, which may not recognize compound extensions.
Validate the full .fb2.zip suffix for book uploads, preserving size validation
and unrestricted supplementary attachments. The server validates the archive.

